A = \left[ {\matrix{ {{e^t}} & {{e^{ - t}}\cos t} & {{e^{ - t}}\sin t}  \cr {{e^t}} & { - {e^{ - t}}\cos t - {e^{ - t}}\sin t} & { - {e^{ - t}}\sin t + {e^{ - t}}co{\mathop{\rm s}\nolimits} t}  \cr {{e^t}} & {2{e^{ - t}}\sin t} & { - 2{e^{ - t}}\cos t}  \cr

} } \right] 


 $\left| A \right|$ = {e^t}.\,{e^{ - t}}.{e^{ - t}}\left| {\matrix{
   1 & {\cos t} & {\sin t}  \cr 
   1 & { - \cos t - \sin t} & { - \sin t + \cos t}  \cr 
   1 & {2\sin t} & { - 2\cos t}  \cr 

 } } \right| 

Apply operations $R_{2}$ < $R_{2} - R_{1}$, $R_{3}$ < $R_{3} - R_{1}$, $R_{1}$ < $R_{1}  \left| A \right|$ = {e^{ - t}}\left| {\matrix{
   1 & {\cos t} & {\sin t}  \cr 
   0 & { - \sin t - 2\cos t} & { - 2\sin t + \cos t}  \cr 
   0 & {2\sin t - \cos t} & { - 2\cos t - \sin t}  \cr 

 } } \right| 

Open the determinant by $R_{1} $\left| A \right|$ = 5{e^{ - t}}$

